      "updated": 1783951190728,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Remove workout time and sets completed info\nwhen on rest time. indiciate that is rest time. for rest\ncontrols only have skip or +60s\nand settings wchich allos a popup modal to change the\ndefault rest time.\nand option to chnage this workout of set e.g. A, B,\nC...etc",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Remove workout time and sets completed info\nwhen on rest time. indiciate that is rest time. for rest controls only have skip or +60s\nand settings wchich allos a popup modal to change the default rest time.\nand option to chnage this workout of set e.g. A, B, C...etc",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
