      "text": "2 - modify the excercise model, so that strenght, legs,\nintermediate should be tags. But special tags (on\ninterpretation, not on the model) so that if says legs, then\nthe logic understand that legs is a special tag, of type legts.\n\n\nFrom: \n- name: \"back squat\"\n    muscle_group: \"legs\"\n    equipment: \"barbell\"\n    category: \"strength\"\n    difficulty: \"intermediate\"\n    icon: \"back_squat\"\n    description: \"Compound lower body exercise targeting\nquadriceps, glutes, and core\"\n    instructions:\n      - \"Stand with feet shoulder-width apart\"\n      - \"Place barbell on upper back\"\n      - \"Lower down by bending knees and hips\"\n      - \"Keep chest up and core engaged\"\n      - \"Drive through heels to return to standing\"\n    default_sets: [1, 2, 3]\n    default_reps: 8\n    tags: [\"gym\"]\n    audio_file: \"audio/workouts/back_squat.mp3\"\n\nShould be simplified to \n\n- name: \"back squat\"\n    icon: \"back_squat\"\n    description: \"Compound lower body exercise targeting\nquadriceps, glutes, and core\"\n    instructions:\n      - \"Stand with feet shoulder-width apart\"\n      - \"Place barbell on upper back\"\n      - \"Lower down by bending knees and hips\"\n      - \"Keep chest up and core engaged\"\n      - \"Drive through heels to return to standing\"\n    default_sets: [1, 2, 3]\n    default_reps: 8\n    tags: [\"gym\", \"legs\", \"barbell\", \"intermediate\"]\n    audio_file: \"audio/workouts/back_squat.mp3\"",
