    {
      "id": "8YdKQQKK3BcJ0kMwXxeCW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2380.545590658592,
      "y": 4607.471190224442,
      "width": 404.1436462402344,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1847956922,
      "version": 222,
      "versionNonce": 40831270,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783956856662,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dont have th etext saying \"special tags... \"\nInstead have recommendation to autocomplete the \nlast not \",\" finished tag\ne.g. writing \"ba\"\n\nwould list as clickeable \"back\", \"barbell\"\nFrom already existing tags from eithe r",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dont have th etext saying \"special tags... \"\nInstead have recommendation to autocomplete the \nlast not \",\" finished tag\ne.g. writing \"ba\"\n\nwould list as clickeable \"back\", \"barbell\"\nFrom already existing tags from eithe r",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wFRqt2hRoGdN_sCmFTPTZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1490.402733515735,
      "y": 5213.471190224442,
      "width": 245.15960693359375,
      "height": 800,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0CV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1049250170,
      "version": 1427,
      "versionNonce": 320759866,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783974593113,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Refactor the ratio and default\nsize of the card here and then\nusing that standard size \nUse the standard for the\nmodal for create, including\nwhere the title looks like and\ncategory should all be icons.\n(do not display the text for\nthe category)\n\nAllow (optional) for adding\nimages from gallery, also do\nnot have collection, nor quote\n(only can add rewards ) so\nremove the entire ratio\nselection in favor of that\n\n\nIn overview from stats, if for\nthe acquired collectible cards,\nif tapped should open the\nsame refactored card\ncomponent\n\nImportant that depending on\nthe type of collectible might\nhave different previews: music\nshould allow for playing the\nmusics. The rooms should be\nable to preview the different\nroom images, etc.Note that\nacquiring a room includes\nacquiring that room music and\nall \"visuals\"\n\n\nAlso acquired collectibles tags\nis missing the rest of the\noptions: room, music, program,\nexercise, guide, etc",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Refactor the ratio and default size of the card here and then \nusing that standard size \nUse the standard for the modal for create, including where the title looks like and category should all be icons. (do not display the text for the category)\n\nAllow (optional) for adding images from gallery, also do not have collection, nor quote (only can add rewards ) so remove the entire ratio selection in favor of that\n\n\nIn overview from stats, if for the acquired collectible cards, if tapped should open the same refactored card component\n\nImportant that depending on the type of collectible might have different previews: music should allow for playing the musics. The rooms should be able to preview the different room images, etc.Note that acquiring a room includes acquiring that room music and all \"visuals\"\n\n\nAlso acquired collectibles tags is missing the rest of the options: room, music, program, exercise, guide, etc",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
