    {
      "id": "UIOlil9cavGe0G0KMgA6K",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1958.8785672581776,
      "y": 6237.217008481037,
      "width": 370.94448309053496,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b15",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1611046758,
      "version": 334,
      "versionNonce": 663036646,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783978580224,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The stats, are not useful\nTo make it useful\ncompare it always to the \"last period\" \nfor example today - compares with yesterday\nweek - compares to last week\n\nhave the absolute value - difference (green or\nred)\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The stats, are not useful\nTo make it useful\ncompare it always to the \"last period\" \nfor example today - compares with yesterday\nweek - compares to last week\n\nhave the absolute value - difference (green or red)\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RfG4lLm0nmdSauADo-RX7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2469.583111830702,
      "y": 7052.280322984247,
      "width": 389.55391818799126,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b15V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 95762298,
      "version": 871,
      "versionNonce": 490266214,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783979098768,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ignore the text size as it is just a sketch\n\nFor create reward, to save on vertical space \ndesign move things around more like this:\n\nFor the action button use the standard common\nwidget buttons.\nThe same for +10 and -10 use the same styling\nlike in workiout where can quickly increase reduce\n\ntapping on the card opens the add image from\ngallery dialog (remove the previous button in\nfavor of this behaviour)\n\nAs you can see title, points cost increase/reduce\nand category are besides the preview card.\n\nThe description should take the remaining\nvertical space as more space allowcated for that\noptional description  ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ignore the text size as it is just a sketch\n\nFor create reward, to save on vertical space \ndesign move things around more like this:\n\nFor the action button use the standard common widget buttons.\nThe same for +10 and -10 use the same styling like in workiout where can quickly increase reduce\n\ntapping on the card opens the add image from gallery dialog (remove the previous button in favor of this behaviour)\n\nAs you can see title, points cost increase/reduce and category are besides the preview card.\n\nThe description should take the remaining vertical space as more space allowcated for that optional description  ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bSeRuksu1m3NHeAkGNNjo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1030.355020815848,
      "y": 6930.495527495082,
      "width": 389.55391818799126,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b15d",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2100365414,
      "version": 1749,
      "versionNonce": 54679398,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783980073347,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Create Card nidak:\nMake the visuals more clean by copying the style\nof edit/create excercise which has simple save\ntext and a bookmark icon.\nAlso the create modal should respect the ratio\nof a card modal (same ratio, size)\n\nAllow cards to be bookmarrked, if bookmarked a\nfilled bookmark icon should appear on top right.\n\nBookmarked cards appear first e.g. in all appears\nfirst. \n\nThe create reward modal should be having the\nsame ratio and size like when you open a card\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Create Card nidak:\nMake the visuals more clean by copying the style of edit/create excercise which has simple save text and a bookmark icon.\nAlso the create modal should respect the ratio of a card modal (same ratio, size)\n\nAllow cards to be bookmarrked, if bookmarked a filled bookmark icon should appear on top right.\n\nBookmarked cards appear first e.g. in all appears first. \n\nThe create reward modal should be having the same ratio and size like when you open a card\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cIjaWfkSizDQDXuruHTdk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1044.0353248568704,
      "y": 7388.507542452652,
      "width": 389.55391818799126,
      "height": 260,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b15h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 601354022,
      "version": 2103,
      "versionNonce": 219052710,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783980073347,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In Stats > Overview   Do not show the card\ntypes in the selector that has not unlocked\nduring the period requested e.g. if no music was\nunlocked this week, and is on week mode, then\ndont show music. \n\nAlso beside \"all\", have \"[bookmark icon]\" which\nfilters all bookmarked cards acquired\n\nin stats> cards screen the first/default type\nshould be [bookmark icon] which shows all\nbookmarked /or adquired etc\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In Stats > Overview   Do not show the card types in the selector that has not unlocked during the period requested e.g. if no music was unlocked this week, and is on week mode, then dont show music. \n\nAlso beside \"all\", have \"[bookmark icon]\" which filters all bookmarked cards acquired\n\nin stats> cards screen the first/default type  should be [bookmark icon] which shows all bookmarked /or adquired etc\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XHUiI_blRezoGmWnItWAv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2490.189390276151,
      "y": 7612.628326764795,
      "width": 389.55391818799126,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b15l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1810674618,
      "version": 915,
      "versionNonce": 819423482,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783979109097,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ignore the text size as it is just a sketch\n\nFor create reward, to save on vertical space \ndesign move things around more like this:\n\nFor the action button use the standard common\nwidget buttons.\nThe same for +10 and -10 use the same styling\nlike in workiout where can quickly increase reduce\n\ntapping on the card opens the add image from\ngallery dialog (remove the previous button in\nfavor of this behaviour)\n\nAs you can see title, points cost increase/reduce\nand category are besides the preview card.\n\nThe description should take the remaining\nvertical space as more space allowcated for that\noptional description  ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ignore the text size as it is just a sketch\n\nFor create reward, to save on vertical space \ndesign move things around more like this:\n\nFor the action button use the standard common widget buttons.\nThe same for +10 and -10 use the same styling like in workiout where can quickly increase reduce\n\ntapping on the card opens the add image from gallery dialog (remove the previous button in favor of this behaviour)\n\nAs you can see title, points cost increase/reduce and category are besides the preview card.\n\nThe description should take the remaining vertical space as more space allowcated for that optional description  ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "lHZl9XlJ1QZuug5-X4xQe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2158.189390276151,
      "y": 8256.628326764796,
      "width": 235.55391818799126,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b15t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1894484582,
      "version": 1274,
      "versionNonce": 532869114,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783980780857,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For the card modal, chnage\nthe acquire button into the\nstandard action in common\nwidget for \nbut change it as \n\nacquire [20pts]\n\nremove the close action\noption as is uneeded.\n\nIf is a reward, allow for\nremoval witha  \"delete\" action\notpion",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For the card modal, chnage the acquire button into the standard action in common widget for \nbut change it as \n\nacquire [20pts]\n\nremove the close action option as is uneeded.\n\nIf is a reward, allow for removal witha  \"delete\" action otpion",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
